    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. We also have some issues with the staff not being thorough enough during the monitoring phase. Sometimes they miss things that are supposedly \"obvious\" but still cause contamination. How can we better train them to spot and prevent these invisible hazards in the kitchen?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
