      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To address invisible hazards, implement a \"Two-Person Cross-Check\" system where one employee monitors critical limits while another verifies the results before recorders. Integrate visual aids and color-coded checklists into daily training sessions to make non-compliant behaviors immediately noticeable and hard to overlook. Lastly, enforce a strict culture of \"stop-and-report\" where any staff member can halt operations if they suspect an invisible contamination risk, ensuring accountability extends beyond regular managers.",
